{
 "uid": "sentinel-pulse-alerts",
 "title": "Sentinel Pulse – operational alerts and RCA",
 "tags": [
  "sentinel-pulse"
 ],
 "timezone": "browser",
 "schemaVersion": 39,
 "version": 2,
 "refresh": "10s",
 "time": {
  "from": "now-6h",
  "to": "now"
 },
 "templating": {
  "list": [
   {
    "name": "datasource",
    "type": "datasource",
    "query": "prometheus",
    "label": "Prometheus"
   }
  ]
 },
 "panels": [
  {
   "id": 1,
   "type": "text",
   "title": "How to read this dashboard",
   "description": "",
   "datasource": {
    "type": "prometheus",
    "uid": "${datasource}"
   },
   "gridPos": {
    "x": 0,
    "y": 0,
    "w": 24,
    "h": 4
   },
   "fieldConfig": {
    "defaults": {
     "unit": "short"
    },
    "overrides": []
   },
   "targets": [],
   "options": {
    "mode": "markdown",
    "content": "Sentinel Pulse runs in **shadow mode**: an alert is a preview of the frozen model and policy, never an automatic response. *Containers alerting* counts open alert episodes; an *episode* is consecutive alerting windows of one container (gap > 3 s ends it). *Immediate* alerts are tripwire hits or RCA cases with a credential, namespace, mount or ptrace operation; probe-only and other cases stay on this dashboard. Episode counts here include attack-campaign trials and Kubernetes exec probes, so they are not the thesis burden metric (normal time only, per replica-hour). Click a case id to open its evidence tree (association by identity and time, not proven causality)."
   }
  },
  {
   "id": 2,
   "type": "stat",
   "title": "Containers alerting now",
   "description": "",
   "datasource": {
    "type": "prometheus",
    "uid": "${datasource}"
   },
   "gridPos": {
    "x": 0,
    "y": 4,
    "w": 4,
    "h": 4
   },
   "fieldConfig": {
    "defaults": {
     "unit": "short"
    },
    "overrides": []
   },
   "targets": [
    {
     "refId": "A",
     "expr": "count(sentinel_pulse_preview_active{pull_profile=\"fast\"}) or vector(0)",
     "legendFormat": "",
     "instant": false
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": 3,
   "type": "stat",
   "title": "Alert episodes in range",
   "description": "",
   "datasource": {
    "type": "prometheus",
    "uid": "${datasource}"
   },
   "gridPos": {
    "x": 4,
    "y": 4,
    "w": 4,
    "h": 4
   },
   "fieldConfig": {
    "defaults": {
     "unit": "short"
    },
    "overrides": []
   },
   "targets": [
    {
     "refId": "A",
     "expr": "sum(increase(sentinel_pulse_bridge_events_total{pull_profile=\"fast\",event=\"episodes_started\"}[$__range]))",
     "legendFormat": "",
     "instant": false
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": 4,
   "type": "stat",
   "title": "Immediate notifications in range",
   "description": "Triage alerts routed to the immediate receiver (tripwire or security operation).",
   "datasource": {
    "type": "prometheus",
    "uid": "${datasource}"
   },
   "gridPos": {
    "x": 8,
    "y": 4,
    "w": 4,
    "h": 4
   },
   "fieldConfig": {
    "defaults": {
     "unit": "short"
    },
    "overrides": []
   },
   "targets": [
    {
     "refId": "A",
     "expr": "sum(increase(sentinel_pulse_bridge_events_total{pull_profile=\"fast\",event=~\"notifications_.*\"}[$__range])) or vector(0)",
     "legendFormat": "",
     "instant": false
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": 5,
   "type": "stat",
   "title": "p95 preview → Alertmanager → webhook (push)",
   "description": "",
   "datasource": {
    "type": "prometheus",
    "uid": "${datasource}"
   },
   "gridPos": {
    "x": 12,
    "y": 4,
    "w": 4,
    "h": 4
   },
   "fieldConfig": {
    "defaults": {
     "unit": "s"
    },
    "overrides": []
   },
   "targets": [
    {
     "refId": "A",
     "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (increase(sentinel_pulse_alert_delivery_seconds_bucket{pull_profile=\"fast\",path=\"push\"}[$__range])))",
     "legendFormat": "",
     "instant": false
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": 6,
   "type": "stat",
   "title": "Decision streams connected",
   "description": "One per worker node; 3 expected.",
   "datasource": {
    "type": "prometheus",
    "uid": "${datasource}"
   },
   "gridPos": {
    "x": 16,
    "y": 4,
    "w": 4,
    "h": 4
   },
   "fieldConfig": {
    "defaults": {
     "unit": "short"
    },
    "overrides": []
   },
   "targets": [
    {
     "refId": "A",
     "expr": "sum(sentinel_pulse_decision_stream_up{pull_profile=\"fast\"})",
     "legendFormat": "",
     "instant": false
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": 7,
   "type": "stat",
   "title": "RCA cases in range",
   "description": "",
   "datasource": {
    "type": "prometheus",
    "uid": "${datasource}"
   },
   "gridPos": {
    "x": 20,
    "y": 4,
    "w": 4,
    "h": 4
   },
   "fieldConfig": {
    "defaults": {
     "unit": "short"
    },
    "overrides": []
   },
   "targets": [
    {
     "refId": "A",
     "expr": "sum(increase(sentinel_pulse_bridge_events_total{pull_profile=\"fast\",event=~\"rca_cases_.*\"}[$__range])) or vector(0)",
     "legendFormat": "",
     "instant": false
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": 8,
   "type": "timeseries",
   "title": "Containers alerting, by workload",
   "description": "",
   "datasource": {
    "type": "prometheus",
    "uid": "${datasource}"
   },
   "gridPos": {
    "x": 0,
    "y": 8,
    "w": 24,
    "h": 8
   },
   "fieldConfig": {
    "defaults": {
     "unit": "short"
    },
    "overrides": []
   },
   "targets": [
    {
     "refId": "A",
     "expr": "count by (workload) (sentinel_pulse_preview_active{pull_profile=\"fast\"})",
     "legendFormat": "{{workload}}",
     "instant": false
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": 9,
   "type": "timeseries",
   "title": "Preview → webhook latency by path (p50 / p95, trailing 30 min)",
   "description": "From the decision preview to the webhook receipt; not kernel → recipient.",
   "datasource": {
    "type": "prometheus",
    "uid": "${datasource}"
   },
   "gridPos": {
    "x": 0,
    "y": 16,
    "w": 12,
    "h": 8
   },
   "fieldConfig": {
    "defaults": {
     "unit": "s"
    },
    "overrides": []
   },
   "targets": [
    {
     "refId": "A",
     "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.5, sum by (le) (increase(sentinel_pulse_alert_delivery_seconds_bucket{pull_profile=\"fast\",path=\"push\"}[30m])))",
     "legendFormat": "p50 push",
     "instant": false
    },
    {
     "refId": "B",
     "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (increase(sentinel_pulse_alert_delivery_seconds_bucket{pull_profile=\"fast\",path=\"push\"}[30m])))",
     "legendFormat": "p95 push",
     "instant": false
    },
    {
     "refId": "C",
     "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.5, sum by (le) (increase(sentinel_pulse_alert_delivery_seconds_bucket{pull_profile=\"fast\",path=\"pull-fast\"}[30m])))",
     "legendFormat": "p50 pull-fast",
     "instant": false
    },
    {
     "refId": "D",
     "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (increase(sentinel_pulse_alert_delivery_seconds_bucket{pull_profile=\"fast\",path=\"pull-fast\"}[30m])))",
     "legendFormat": "p95 pull-fast",
     "instant": false
    },
    {
     "refId": "E",
     "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.5, sum by (le) (increase(sentinel_pulse_alert_delivery_seconds_bucket{pull_profile=\"fast\",path=\"pull-default\"}[30m])))",
     "legendFormat": "p50 pull-default",
     "instant": false
    },
    {
     "refId": "F",
     "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (increase(sentinel_pulse_alert_delivery_seconds_bucket{pull_profile=\"fast\",path=\"pull-default\"}[30m])))",
     "legendFormat": "p95 pull-default",
     "instant": false
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": 10,
   "type": "timeseries",
   "title": "RCA cases per hour, by triage class",
   "description": "",
   "datasource": {
    "type": "prometheus",
    "uid": "${datasource}"
   },
   "gridPos": {
    "x": 12,
    "y": 16,
    "w": 12,
    "h": 8
   },
   "fieldConfig": {
    "defaults": {
     "unit": "short"
    },
    "overrides": []
   },
   "targets": [
    {
     "refId": "A",
     "expr": "sum(increase(sentinel_pulse_bridge_events_total{pull_profile=\"fast\",event=\"rca_cases_tripwire\"}[1h]))",
     "legendFormat": "tripwire",
     "instant": false
    },
    {
     "refId": "B",
     "expr": "sum(increase(sentinel_pulse_bridge_events_total{pull_profile=\"fast\",event=\"rca_cases_security_operation\"}[1h]))",
     "legendFormat": "security_operation",
     "instant": false
    },
    {
     "refId": "C",
     "expr": "sum(increase(sentinel_pulse_bridge_events_total{pull_profile=\"fast\",event=\"rca_cases_new_binary\"}[1h]))",
     "legendFormat": "new_binary",
     "instant": false
    },
    {
     "refId": "D",
     "expr": "sum(increase(sentinel_pulse_bridge_events_total{pull_profile=\"fast\",event=\"rca_cases_probe_only\"}[1h]))",
     "legendFormat": "probe_only",
     "instant": false
    },
    {
     "refId": "E",
     "expr": "sum(increase(sentinel_pulse_bridge_events_total{pull_profile=\"fast\",event=\"rca_cases_other\"}[1h]))",
     "legendFormat": "other",
     "instant": false
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": 11,
   "type": "timeseries",
   "title": "Alert episodes per hour (whole cluster)",
   "description": "",
   "datasource": {
    "type": "prometheus",
    "uid": "${datasource}"
   },
   "gridPos": {
    "x": 0,
    "y": 24,
    "w": 12,
    "h": 8
   },
   "fieldConfig": {
    "defaults": {
     "unit": "short"
    },
    "overrides": []
   },
   "targets": [
    {
     "refId": "A",
     "expr": "sum(increase(sentinel_pulse_bridge_events_total{pull_profile=\"fast\",event=\"episodes_started\"}[1h]))",
     "legendFormat": "episodes/hour",
     "instant": false
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": 12,
   "type": "timeseries",
   "title": "Immediate notifications per hour, by class",
   "description": "",
   "datasource": {
    "type": "prometheus",
    "uid": "${datasource}"
   },
   "gridPos": {
    "x": 12,
    "y": 24,
    "w": 12,
    "h": 8
   },
   "fieldConfig": {
    "defaults": {
     "unit": "short"
    },
    "overrides": []
   },
   "targets": [
    {
     "refId": "A",
     "expr": "sum(increase(sentinel_pulse_bridge_events_total{pull_profile=\"fast\",event=\"notifications_tripwire\"}[1h]))",
     "legendFormat": "tripwire",
     "instant": false
    },
    {
     "refId": "B",
     "expr": "sum(increase(sentinel_pulse_bridge_events_total{pull_profile=\"fast\",event=\"notifications_security_operation\"}[1h]))",
     "legendFormat": "security_operation",
     "instant": false
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": 13,
   "type": "table",
   "title": "Recent RCA cases (last 6 h)",
   "description": "From the alert bridge (/cases.json). Case opens the English case page; Tree opens the SVG drawing.",
   "datasource": {
    "type": "yesoreyeram-infinity-datasource",
    "uid": "sentinel-pulse-infinity"
   },
   "gridPos": {
    "x": 0,
    "y": 32,
    "w": 24,
    "h": 12
   },
   "fieldConfig": {
    "defaults": {
     "unit": "short"
    },
    "overrides": [
     {
      "matcher": {
       "id": "byName",
       "options": "Case"
      },
      "properties": [
       {
        "id": "links",
        "value": [
         {
          "title": "Open RCA case",
          "url": "http://10.1.16.234:9478/cases/${__value.raw}",
          "targetBlank": true
         }
        ]
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "matcher": {
       "id": "byName",
       "options": "Tree"
      },
      "properties": [
       {
        "id": "links",
        "value": [
         {
          "title": "Open evidence tree (SVG)",
          "url": "${__value.raw}",
          "targetBlank": true
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "id": "mappings",
        "value": [
         {
          "type": "regex",
          "options": {
           "pattern": ".*",
           "result": {
            "text": "open tree"
           }
          }
         }
        ]
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "matcher": {
       "id": "byName",
       "options": "Notify"
      },
      "properties": [
       {
        "id": "custom.cellOptions",
        "value": {
         "type": "color-background"
        }
       },
       {
        "id": "mappings",
        "value": [
         {
          "type": "value",
          "options": {
           "immediate": {
            "color": "red",
            "index": 0
           },
           "dashboard": {
            "color": "transparent",
            "index": 1
           }
          }
         }
        ]
       }
      ]
     }
    ]
   },
   "targets": [
    {
     "refId": "A",
     "datasource": {
      "type": "yesoreyeram-infinity-datasource",
      "uid": "sentinel-pulse-infinity"
     },
     "type": "json",
     "source": "url",
     "format": "table",
     "parser": "backend",
     "url": "http://10.1.16.234:9478/cases.json?hours=6",
     "url_options": {
      "method": "GET"
     },
     "columns": [
      {
       "selector": "created_at",
       "text": "Created",
       "type": "timestamp_epoch_s"
      },
      {
       "selector": "case_id",
       "text": "Case",
       "type": "string"
      },
      {
       "selector": "rca_class",
       "text": "Class",
       "type": "string"
      },
      {
       "selector": "notify",
       "text": "Notify",
       "type": "string"
      },
      {
       "selector": "workload",
       "text": "Workload",
       "type": "string"
      },
      {
       "selector": "node",
       "text": "Node",
       "type": "string"
      },
      {
       "selector": "top_binary",
       "text": "Top suspect",
       "type": "string"
      },
      {
       "selector": "top_reasons",
       "text": "Reasons",
       "type": "string"
      },
      {
       "selector": "top_score",
       "text": "Score",
       "type": "number"
      },
      {
       "selector": "connections",
       "text": "Network destinations",
       "type": "number"
      },
      {
       "selector": "svg_url",
       "text": "Tree",
       "type": "string"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
   "options": {
    "showHeader": true,
    "sortBy": [
     {
      "displayName": "Created",
      "desc": true
     }
    ]
   }
  },
  {
   "id": 14,
   "type": "table",
   "title": "Pulse alerts firing in Prometheus (pull path)",
   "description": "",
   "datasource": {
    "type": "prometheus",
    "uid": "${datasource}"
   },
   "gridPos": {
    "x": 0,
    "y": 44,
    "w": 24,
    "h": 8
   },
   "fieldConfig": {
    "defaults": {
     "unit": "short"
    },
    "overrides": []
   },
   "targets": [
    {
     "refId": "A",
     "expr": "ALERTS{alertname=\"SentinelPulseAnomalyPull\",alertstate=\"firing\",path=\"pull-fast\"}",
     "legendFormat": "",
     "instant": true
    }
   ],
   "options": {
    "showHeader": true
   }
  }
 ]
}
